ttmath provides header-only libraries. To use it, include:

    #include <ttmath/ttmath.h>

In CMake projects:

    find_path(TTMATH_INCLUDE_DIRS "ttmath/ttmath.h")
    target_include_directories(main PRIVATE ${TTMATH_INCLUDE_DIRS})

Note for 64-bit MSVC users: define TTMATH_NOASM if not linking custom assembly.
